{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/8decc7cf315f96323634525cde0fc538.avif?t=1769956025\" width=582 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come in! Nightclub with neon Rhythm Story sign. Music and fun give way to screams. The corpse of the girl was found in the toilet. Panic. The detective is ready. What evidence is there? What is the motive? An atmospheric rhythm adventure with a deep storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/19da4b7cb59fead89ca1ccb262be6c3d.avif?t=1769956025\" width=612 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mei and Rei have been best friends since childhood, but recently Rei began to go somewhere every evening, and return in the morning. She used to have problems with the law, but May hoped that was in the past. They started going to the Rhythm Story nightclub and everything was fine ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one of the girls was found dead there</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The detective will get down to business to understand what is really going on in their city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is inspired by Rhythm Doctor and Friday Night Funkin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653310/extras/19e8ed06929253ca7856176e41d20606.avif?t=1769956025\" width=620 height=262 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2981 Easy to play and atmospheric visual novel with rhythm games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2981 You will 